### 1. Block local configuration environment keys globally across all scopes

**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/*.env 

### 2. Match and skip dependencies dynamically anywhere they spawn

**/node_modules/
**/node_modules/**/* 

### 3. Block nested serverless build caches and compiled assets

**/dist/
**/.next/
**/.wrangler/ 

### 4. Standard hidden system boundaries

.git/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db